      "translations": {
        "en": "The foolish among the people will say, 'What has turned them away from their qiblah which they used to face?' Say, 'To Allah belongs the east and the west. Allah guides whom He wills to a straight path.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
